# Agent tooling. `next dev` writes CLAUDE.md on every run as a pointer to
# AGENTS.md, so it regenerates locally and does not belong in the repository.
# AGENTS.md itself is kept: its note about Next 16's breaking changes is a real
# engineering warning, and its name is not tied to any one tool.
CLAUDE.md
